\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Jesus always care for us
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 than the care from a good shepherd
\par He reveals to us good things
\par He has for all of His children
\par We are part of Jesus's flock
\par He has bought us with His blood.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The redemption of mankind
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 made Him turned to a human flesh
\par He replaced us for our sins
\par and paid the price of all our sins,
\par If we give ourselves to Him
\par we shall have all His blessings.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Whosoever needs Jesus
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 whosoever yearns for Jesus
\par such a person then can see
\par that His saviour's love is so great;
\par He will prosper on this earth
\par \pard      and in heaven be fulfilled.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

